{
  "methodology": "Qualitative profiles are derived from catalog categories and capabilities, then sharpened by small reviewable overrides for widely used platforms. Scores model relative fit rather than universal quality.",
  "disclaimer": "Recommendations are qualitative discovery aids, not price quotes or purchasing advice. Verify current prices, quotas, regions, compliance, support, and product status with the provider.",
  "dimensions": {
    "expertise_required": "Relative operational and platform expertise required, from 1 (beginner) to 5 (specialist).",
